  (text "ECU pin 30 -- crank sensor shield, terminated at THIS end only. Grounding both ends makes the shield a second conductor\nbetween two grounds that differ by the injector return current, and that current then flows down the shield around the\npair it is there to protect." (at 330.0 165.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left))
    (uuid 0bf7a07f-01b2-4711-9fd5-53bf1ee3bb69)
  )
